** MATERIAL DEFINITION WITH FIELD VARIABLE DEPENDENCY
** =================================================================
*MATERIAL, NAME=WATER_GRADED
** Density varies with field variable FV1
** FV1 represents normalized x-coordinate (0 to 1)
** rho(x) = 1020 + 15*(x/L) kg/m³
*DENSITY, DEPENDENCIES=1
