** =================================================================
** SECTION ASSIGNMENT
** =================================================================
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=FLUID_DOMAIN, MATERIAL=WATER_GRADED
**
** =================================================================
** FIELD VARIABLE DEFINITION
** =================================================================
** Define initial field variable distribution
** FV1 = X/L where L=10m is domain length
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=FIELD
** For each node, specify FV1 value based on x-coordinate
** This creates a linear gradient from 0 to 1
FLUID_DOMAIN, 1, 0.0, 0.0
** Note: In practice, this would be defined for each node or using
** an analytical field in Abaqus/CAE
**
** Alternative: Define using FIELD keyword in step
** =================================================================
** ASSEMBLY
** =================================================================
*END PART
**
*ASSEMBLY, NAME=ASSEMBLY
*INSTANCE, NAME=FLUID-1, PART=PART-1
*END INSTANCE
**
** NODE SETS IN ASSEMBLY
*NSET, NSET=ALL_NODES, INSTANCE=FLUID-1
1,
*END ASSEMBLY
